# Silithus - Recipes companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose source is physically in Silithus (zone 1451), verified
# against the local Forever game data: 50 vendor-sold (Kania, Aendel
# Windspear, Mishta, Vargus, Zannok Hidepiercer, Enkles) and 2 dropped solely
# or narrowly by in-zone mobs (see docs/silithus-companions-inventory.md).
# Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
# Every buy line carries an npc pin to its in-zone vendor. No stock-class
# flag exists in the data, so nothing is marked limited. Quinard's matching
# stock is excluded: he is Horde-flagged and the Alliance buys from Enkles.
# Engineering, Mining, Herbalism, Skinning, Fishing and Alchemy have no
# in-zone source and say so below instead of padding. This guide never
# accepts or turns in.
guide butler-routes-completionist/silithus-recipes
title Silithus - Recipes & Patterns
levels 54-60
zone Silithus
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
coords live
version 1

step Enchanting - Cenarion Hold (Kania)

  zone map 1451

  when skill Enchanting 1

  vendor 15419 -- Kania (51.97, 39.7)
  buy 6342 "Formula: Enchant Chest - Minor Mana" npc 15419
  buy 20732 "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Greater Fire Resistance" npc 15419
  buy 20733 "Formula: Enchant Cloak - Greater Nature Resistance" npc 15419
  buy 20752 "Formula: Minor Mana Oil" npc 15419
  buy 20753 "Formula: Lesser Wizard Oil" npc 15419
  buy 20754 "Formula: Lesser Mana Oil" npc 15419
  buy 20755 "Formula: Wizard Oil" npc 15419
  buy 20758 "Formula: Minor Wizard Oil" npc 15419
  buy 234271 "Formula: Scroll: Wrath of the Swarm" npc 15419
  buy 234272 "Formula: Enchanted Repellent" npc 15419
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

