step Tailoring - Twilight grounds (Geolord drop)

  zone map 1451

  when skill Tailoring 1

  collect 20546 "Pattern: Runed Stygian Leggings" optional
  note Drops solely from Twilight Geolords anywhere in the data - farm the Templar grounds west, central or south. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Leatherworking - north-central wastes (Windreaver drop)

  zone map 1451

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  collect 21548 "Pattern: Stormshroud Gloves" optional
  note Drops from The Windreaver (28.66, 26.85) - see the rares companion - and otherwise only from Princess Tempestria in Winterspring. Respawn timer unconfirmed.

